          "body": "Persistence layer done (needed before PM-36). crates/pm-core/src/config.rs is a plain-JSON key/value document - no sqlite - at ~/.pm/config.json, with atomic writes and defaults on missing/broken. crates/pm-ui/src/config.rs exposes it as a gpui global: ConfigStore::get(cx) / ConfigStore::update(cx, |c| ...) (persist + refresh_windows). Loaded in main.rs; writes the default file on first run. First field is ui_scale. Verified: unit tests + hand-edited ui_scale=1.75 survives a restart. Still open on this ticket: letting the user choose where PROJECT ticket data lives (in-repo .pm/pm.json5 vs ~/.pm/<slug>/) - that needs pm_core::pm load/save to take a path.",
